# Python bytecode cache (e.g. from running/compiling skill scripts)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The client-intelligence review dashboard is a BUILD ARTIFACT, never a repo file.
# `.claude/skills/client-intelligence/render/build.mjs` writes it to the repo root by
# default, and it renders every client file into one page — so it carries client data
# that this repo must not hold. It ships to Lilian as an Artifact and is thrown away.
# Without this line a session (or a "you have untracked files" prompt) commits it.
ci-review-dashboard.html
